#: src/architecture.md:47
msgid "SMB, then NFS and WebDAV"
msgstr "SMB, puis NFS et WebDAV"

#: src/architecture.md:47
msgid "SMB covers most homes. NFS is suggested first when the host offers it. See [ADR-0005](adr/0005-network-protocols.md)."
msgstr "SMB couvre la plupart des foyers. NFS est proposé en premier quand la machine le propose. Voir l'[ADR-0005](adr/0005-network-protocols.md)."

